{"5":[{"k":"p","t":"PARTS LIST"},{"k":"p","t":"There are two different kits available for Alien vs. Predator. The first kit below is the full kit which includes PCB, all necessary graphics, buttons, joysticks and a volume/test bracket. This kit is used for a cabinet that will be upgraded with the CPS II board for the first time. The second kit is called the \"B\" Kit. This kit is for any cabinet that already uses the CPS II board (Super Street Fighter II). This kit includes the \"B\" board and all necessary graphics. Just remove the top cartridge off the motherboard and replace with the new cartridge."},{"k":"p","t":"AP1000 Alien vs. Predator Kit"},{"k":"p","t":"Part No. Description Qty."},{"k":"tr","t":"03-0050   Momentary Switch Assembly   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0066   Side Graphics   2"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0074   Blue Marble Overlay   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0077   Alien vs. Predator Instruction Label   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0076   Alien vs. Predator Marque   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0130   Player 1 Start Button   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0131   Player 2 Start Button   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0132   Player 3 Start Button   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0133   Red Button   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0134   Blue Button   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"16-0136   Green Button   3"},{"k":"tr","t":"19-0016   Alien vs. Predator Manual   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"AP1400   Alien vs. Predator PCB   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"GE1200   Monitor Card   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"GE2030   Joystick   3."},{"k":"p","t":"AP1000B Alien vs. Predator B Kit"},{"k":"p","t":"Part No. Description Qty."},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0074   Blue Marble Overlay   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0076   Alien vs. Predator Marque   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"06-0077   Alien vs. Predator Instruction Label   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"19-0016   Alien vs. Predator Manual   1"},{"k":"tr","t":"AP1400B   Alien vs. Predator \"B\" PCB   1"}],"7":[{"k":"h","t":"CONNECTORS"},{"k":"p","t":". JAMMA: . OPTION: . AUDIO OUT: . REGISTER: JAMMA 56-pin connector Player 3 Interface and Volume Control Used o